Subject: mods to base model class to support log prob w/o Jacobian?
Message-ID: <sINyru_wAGQ.GE5WzswJROkJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-dev/c/sINyru_wAGQ/m/GE5WzswJROkJ>
