I agree that the Bugs models should not be the only benchmark.  But they are _a_ benchmark.  If runtimes are just too fast, we can to the wall time needed for an effective sample size of 1000.

But, yes, let's also define a few other benchmarks that are more difficult than the Bugs examples, I agree.

A

