In any case, I think we're all agreed that we want the Stan versions of the Bugs models to have vectorization, bernoulli_logit, and the Matt trick where possible.  And the Jags starting points where they exist.  I do want all these to run, because this will give us something to point to. We should also be working on the Ben benchmarks.
A

