Also note that implicit functions, if they can be defined as a holonomic constraints f( alpha ) = 0, can be incorporated directly in the integration using the RATTLE integrator, a la Marcus's work: http://www.cs.toronto.edu/~mbrubake/projects/cmcmc/.

