From u8aa9b8cc06fdc99c at groups.google.com  Wed Jul 17 22:39:53 2013
From: u8aa9b8cc06fdc99c at groups.google.com (Bob Carpenter)
Date: Wed, 17 Jul 2013 22:39:53 +0000
Subject: almost there on model refactor
Message-ID: <77PddKjgNBU.00R8Mrif37IJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-dev/c/77PddKjgNBU/m/00R8Mrif37IJ>
