On Thursday, July 25, 2013 1:09:13 PM UTC-4, Peter Li wrote:
> I'm not sure what version of tar I have but that seemed to have worked. Thanks. I'll let you know which models (if any) can't be run with rstanarm.

We already know that anything multilevel won't work yet because we don't have a stanlmer() function yet. Basically, we just have stanglm() so far, although I guess that is sufficient to do a lot. I made a wiki page

https://github.com/stan-dev/rstanarm/wiki/Models-from-ARM-Book

that I think you can edit.

Ben

