a) I went back to the original progress output, so the percent complete assumes that the current iteration has already finished (it looked awkward otherwise).

b) But I added an automatic output of the final sample so you'll always see progress warnings for the first and last sample.

c) Because Nesterov seems to be working for me I didn't trash it, but I did change the default optimization algorithm to BFGS.

I think that addresses all of the outstanding issues -- did I miss anything?

